/etc  - system-wide config
/var  - files that change a lot
/proc - kernel, auto-generated
/boot - usually ignore
/sys  - device, driver, kernel features
/dev  - hardware + virtual devices
/bin  - binaries, linked to /usr/bin
/lib  - library files for bins, linked to /usr/lib
/opt  - packages, /opt/aws
/home - user directory, /home/ec2-user
/tmp  - delete after reboot
/usr  - /bin, /lib, /local for stuff not installed in /opt